<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:80%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S2.F2.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:113%;">Fig. 2</span>: </span><span id="S2.F2.9" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:113%;">Exemplary road network with lanes defined by lanelets. The ego vehicle is currently following lane <math id="S2.F2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L_{\mathrm{cur}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>cur</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L_{\mathrm{cur}}</annotation></semantics></math>, as determined by the high-level routing module to reach the goal. Alternatively, it may switch to the left-adjacent lane <math id="S2.F2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L_{\mathrm{adj\_l}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>adj</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L_{\mathrm{adj\_l}}</annotation></semantics></math>
instead of remaining on <math id="S2.F2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L_{\mathrm{cur}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>cur</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L_{\mathrm{cur}}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="S2.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection"><span id="S2.SS2.6" class="ltx_text">II-B</span> </span><span id="S2.SS2.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Specification-Compliant Reachability Analysis</span></h3>

